Consider validating that the length of indexValues matches the length of indexInfo.Columns to avoid potential out-of-bound errors when indexing into tblInfo.Columns.
```suggestion
func needsPartitionPruning(sctx sessionctx.Context, tblInfo *model.TableInfo, pt table.PartitionedTable, dbName string, indexInfo *model.IndexInfo, indexCols []*expression.Column, indexValues []types.Datum, conds []expression.Expression, partitionNames []ast.CIStr) ([]int, bool, error) {
	if len(indexValues) != len(indexInfo.Columns) {
		return nil, false, errors.New("length of indexValues does not match length of indexInfo.Columns")
	}
```
